# 🎯 BidReady AI

## Know Before You Bid.

BidReady AI is a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) application that helps businesses evaluate whether a tender appears suitable for their company.

Users upload:

1. A tender / RFP PDF
2. A company profile PDF

They can then ask questions such as:

> Is this tender suitable for my company?

> What mandatory requirements do we fail?

> What experience is required?

> What are our biggest risks?

> Should we BID, BID WITH CONDITIONS, or NO-BID?

---

# 🧠 How BidReady AI Works

The application uses a RAG pipeline:

```text
Tender PDF
      +
Company Profile PDF
      ↓
   PyMuPDF
      ↓
Text Extraction
      ↓
Chunking
      ↓
Sentence Transformers
      ↓
Semantic Embeddings
      ↓
FAISS Vector Index
      ↓
Relevant Evidence Retrieval
      ↓
Groq
openai/gpt-oss-20b
      ↓
AI Reasoning
      ↓
Bid Suitability Answer
````

---

# 🛠️ Technology Stack

| Technology            | Purpose                  |
| --------------------- | ------------------------ |
| Streamlit             | Web application          |
| PyMuPDF               | PDF text extraction      |
| Sentence Transformers | Semantic embeddings      |
| FAISS                 | Vector similarity search |
| Groq                  | LLM inference            |
| `openai/gpt-oss-20b`  | AI reasoning             |
| Python                | Application logic        |

---

